# FILE 7 — `georoute/processing/alignment.py`
### Role: Spatial Registration — "Make Everything Perfectly Aligned"

**Libraries: `rasterio`, `rasterio.warp`, `geopandas`, `numpy`, `pyproj`, `tenacity`**

This is the most technically complex module. It takes raw data from two completely different coordinate systems (WGS84 imagery and DEM) and forces them onto a single shared pixel grid.

---

### Block 1 — `AlignedRasterData` Dataclass

```python
