**The bbox used (Munich area, ~10km × ~10km):**
- Longitude span: 11.535 − 11.400 = 0.135° ≈ ~10.3km at 48°N latitude
- Latitude span: 48.190 − 48.100 = 0.090° ≈ ~10.0km

This maps to UTM Zone 32N (EPSG:32632) — verified by `get_utm_crs_for_bbox(11.4, 48.1, 11.535, 48.19)`.

