# 🔄 Complete Data Flow Summary

```
config/config.yaml + .env
    │
    ▼ PipelineConfig.from_yaml()  [pydantic validation]
    │
    ▼ get_utm_crs_for_bbox()      [pyproj → EPSG:32632]
    │
    ▼ compute_target_raster_grid() [rasterio.transform → Affine, 1340×910 px]
    │
    ├──► OSMVectorIngestor.fetch_all()
    │       └── osmnx.features_from_polygon() → GeoDataFrame (EPSG:4326)
    │       └── _sanitize_geodataframe() → clean geometries
    │
    ├──► STACRasterIngestor.search_optical_scene()
    │       └── pystac_client.Client.search() → least-cloudy Sentinel-2 item
    │       └── planetary_computer.sign_inplace() → signed band URLs
    │
    ├──► STACRasterIngestor.search_dem()
    │       └── pystac_client.Client.search() → 1–4 DEM tile URLs
    │
    ├──► SpatialAligner.reproject_vectors()
    │       └── GeoDataFrame.to_crs(EPSG:32632) → metric coordinates + length_m/area_m2
    │
    ├──► SpatialAligner.resample_and_align_optical()
    │       └── rasterio.open(url) [VSICURL streaming]
    │       └── rasterio.warp.reproject() × 4 bands → np.ndarray (4, H, W) float32
    │
    ├──► SpatialAligner.resample_and_align_dem()
    │       └── rasterio.open(tile_url) [VSICURL streaming]
    │       └── rasterio.warp.reproject() × N tiles → mosaic → np.ndarray (1, H, W) float32
    │
    ├──► SpatialAligner.verify_co_registration()  [3 assertions]
    │
    └──► GeoDataExporter
            ├── export_vector_layers() → highways.geojson, buildings.geojson, environmental_zones.geojson
            ├── export_cog(optical)   → optical_sentinel2_10m_*.tif [COG, 4-band, DEFLATE]
            └── export_cog(dem)       → dem_copernicus_10m_*.tif    [COG, 1-band, DEFLATE]
```

